Model (not included; downloaded at run time from Hugging Face)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Ahenk Cep (https://huggingface.co/ozgurguler/ahenk-cep-tr), weights CC BY 4.0.
"Ahenk Cep, Ahenk (https://github.com/ozguradmin/ahenk-turkish-tts), CC BY 4.0."
It derives from EMA Lightning (https://huggingface.co/canberkkkkkk/ema-lightning), Apache-2.0, and learned from the
voice of Ahenk, trained with Alania Turkish Synthetic Speech by PatientDesk AI
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/cloud0day3/alania-synthetic-speech-tr) and Alania Turkish Domain Text by
PatientDesk AI (https://huggingface.co/datasets/cloud0day3/alania-domain-text-tr), licensed under CC BY 4.0.

